          "name": "Test Webhook",
          "request": {
            "name": "Test Webhook",
            "description": {
              "content": "Test your webhook endpoint by triggering a sample payload. Useful for verifying your webhook receiver is working correctly.\n\nThe test payload varies by webhook type:\n- **ENRICHMENT_DATA**: Sample enriched transactions payload\n- **ENRICHMENT_NOTIFICATION**: Sample batch notification with batch_request_id\n- **USER_TAGS_DATA**: Sample user tags payload with created/deleted/modified arrays\n- **USER_TAGS_NOTIFICATION**: Sample notification with guid\n- **INSIGHTS**: Sample finsights array\n\nAll test webhooks include the `X-Webhook-Verification` header for signature verification testing.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "webhook-configurations",
                "test"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                {
                  "key": "scope",
                  "value": "enrichment"
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessTokenUrl",
                  "value": "https://findmoney.fingoal.com/v3/authentication"
                },
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"webhook_type\": \"<string>\",\n  \"callback_url\": \"<uri>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "495d4b56-b125-4613-a32b-19eb45a31c98",
